    "extract": "Supergiants are among the most massive and most luminous stars. Supergiant stars occupy the top region of the Hertzsprung–Russell diagram, with absolute visual magnitudes between about −3 and −8. The temperatures of supergiant stars range from about 3,400 K to over 20,000 K.",
    "firstParagraph": "Supergiants are among the most massive and most luminous stars. Supergiant stars occupy the top region of the Hertzsprung–Russell diagram, with absolute visual magnitudes between about −3 and −8. The temperatures of supergiant stars range from about 3,400 K to over 20,000 K.",
    "leadHtml": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"shortdescription nomobile noexcerpt noprint searchaux\" style=\"display:none\">Type of star that is massive and luminous</div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1353705441\">.mw-parser-output .hatnote{font-style:italic}.mw-parser-output div.hatnote{padding-left:1.6em;margin-bottom:0.5em}.mw-parser-output .hatnote i{font-style:normal}.mw-parser-output .hatnote+span.mw-empty-elt+.hatnote,.mw-parser-output .hatnote+link+.hatnote{margin-top:-0.5em}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .hatnote{display:none!important}}</style><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Supergiant_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"Supergiant (disambiguation)\">Supergiant (disambiguation)</a>.</div>\n<p><b>Supergiants</b> are among the most massive and most luminous <a href=\"/wiki/Star\" title=\"Star\">stars</a>. <b>Supergiant stars</b> occupy the top region of the <a href=\"/wiki/Hertzsprung%E2%80%93Russell_diagram\" title=\"Hertzsprung–Russell diagram\">Hertzsprung–Russell diagram</a>, with <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_magnitude\" title=\"Absolute magnitude\">absolute visual magnitudes</a> between about −3 and −8. The temperatures of supergiant stars range from about 3,400&#160;K to over 20,000&#160;K.\n</p>\n<div role=\"img\" class=\"floatright noresize\" style=\"width: 400px; line-height: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #ffffff; color:inherit; position: relative;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:HR-diag-no-text-2.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/HR-diag-no-text-2.svg/500px-HR-diag-no-text-2.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"457\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/HR-diag-no-text-2.svg/960px-HR-diag-no-text-2.svg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"585\" /></a></span>\n<div style=\"position:absolute; left:74px; top:392px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hertzsprung%E2%80%93Russell_diagram\" title=\"Hertzsprung–Russell diagram\"><span style=\"color: #000080; font-size: 110%\">Hertzsprung–Russell diagram</span></a></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute; left:182px; top:432px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_classification\" title=\"Stellar classification\"><span style=\"color: #000080; font-size: 120%\">Spectral type</span></a></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute; left:84px; top:418px\"><a href=\"/wiki/O-class_star\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"O-class star\"><span style=\"color: black; background-color: white; font-size: 100% font-weight:bold\">O</span></a></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute; left:120px; top:418px\"><a href=\"/wiki/B-class_star\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"B-class star\"><span style=\"color: black; background-color: white; font-size: 100% font-weight:bold\">B</span></a></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute; left:158px; top:418px\"><a href=\"/wiki/A-class_star\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"A-class star\"><span style=\"color: black; background-color: white; font-size: 100% font-weight:bold\">A</span></a></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute; left:196px; top:418px\"><a href=\"/wiki/F-class_star\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"F-class star\"><span style=\"color: black; background-color: white; font-size: 100% font-weight:bold\">F</span></a></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute; left:230px; top:418px\"><a href=\"/wiki/G-class_star\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"G-class star\"><span style=\"color: black; background-color: white; font-size: 100% font-weight:bold\">G</span></a></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute; left:268px; top:418px\"><a href=\"/wiki/K-class_star\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"K-class star\"><span style=\"color: black; background-color: white; font-size: 100% font-weight:bold\">K</span></a></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute; left:302px; top:418px\"><a href=